cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Understanding Graph in your research, please cite the
  preprint below. The software metadata at the top of this file is
  also valid as a standalone software citation.
title: "Understanding Graph: A Recursive Medium for Persistent Understanding"
version: 0.1.30
abstract: >-
  Understanding Graph is an MCP server for structured, persistent,
  revisable understanding. Agents externalize material questions,
  tensions, surprises, decisions, and revisions as typed testimony;
  re-enter prior graph state at meaningful choice points; and keep
  addressable document or code artifacts in the same workspace. The
  graph records communicable understanding, not hidden chain-of-thought.
authors:
